{"path":"container/list/assign_range","title":"std::list<T,Allocator>::assign_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>assign_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/list/assign_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces elements in the container with a copy of each element in rg.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> assign_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces elements in the container with a copy of each element in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code>.\n</p><p>All iterators (including the <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/end\"><code>end()</code></a> iterator) and all references to the elements are invalidated.\n</p><p>Each iterator in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced exactly once.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> overlaps with the container.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> with reference type convertible to the element type of the container\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/assignable_from\"><span class=\"kw2960\">std::<span class=\"me2\">assignable_from</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range_reference_t\"><span class=\"kw2913\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">range_reference_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span></span></code> must be modeled. Otherwise, the program is ill-formed.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>T</code> must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/EmplaceConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">EmplaceConstructible</em></a> into the container from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_containers_ranges\"><code>__cpp_lib_containers_ranges</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_containers_ranges_202202L\"><code>202202L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">Ranges-aware</a> construction and insertion\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> source <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> destination <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#ifdef __cpp_lib_containers_ranges</span>\n    destination.<span class=\"me1\">assign_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>source<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    destination.<span class=\"me1\">assign</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>source.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, source.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/equal\"><span class=\"kw2998\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">equal</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>source, destination<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/insert_range\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert_range</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/prepend_range\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>prepend_range</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds a range of elements to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/append_range\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>append_range</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds a range of elements to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/assign\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>assign</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns values to the container <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns values to the container <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/list","title":"std::list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::list<T,Allocator>::assign_range","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Replaces elements in the container with a copy of each element in rg."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"insert_range","note":"inserts a range of elements"},{"label":"prepend_range","note":"adds a range of elements to the beginning"},{"label":"append_range","note":"adds a range of elements to the end"},{"label":"assign","note":"assigns values to the container"},{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns values to the container"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":203,"codeBlockCount":1}
